        "accordion_zBGHUq": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "FAQ",
            "content": "<h4>How Durable Is The 4-in-1 Cable?</h4><p>The 4-in-1 Cable is engineered with reinforced materials and superior construction, ensuring it withstands daily wear and tear. This robust design guarantees durability and longevity, so you can say goodbye to frayed and broken cables.</p><h4>Does It Support Fast Charging?</h4><p>Absolutely! The 4-in-1 Cable supports blazing 100W fast charging, ensuring your devices are powered up quickly and efficiently. Experience maximum charging speed and keep your devices ready for action.</p><h4>What Devices Can I Charge With This Cable?</h4><p>The 4-in-1 Cable is designed to charge a wide range of devices, including phones, speakers, cameras, and even gaming controllers like your Xbox controller. It's the ultimate solution for all your charging needs.</p><h4>Does It Include Cable Tie?</h4><p>Yes, it does. The 4-in-1 Cable comes with an innovative Tidy Cable Tie, which keeps your space organized and clutter-free. No more tangled messes or unruly cords – just neat and manageable cable storage.</p><h4>Is This Cable Compatible With My Devices?</h4><p>Our 4-in-1 Cable is universally compatible with its interchangeable heads. Effortlessly switch between USB-C & Lightning plugs, and between USB-A & USB-C connectors, making it suitable for all your devices.</p><h4>Can I Use It With Power Banks and Car Chargers?</h4><p>Yes, the 4-in-1 Cable seamlessly integrates with power banks, car chargers, and other charging accessories. Its universal compatibility ensures it works well with all your gear.</p><h4>Is It Safe For My Devices?</h4><p>Absolutely. The 4-in-1 Cable delivers fast charging at levels supported by your devices, ensuring efficient and safe power delivery. Pair it with high-quality charging sources for the best results.</p><h4>How Can I Track My Order?</h4><p>All shipments are trackable through the Track Order page on our website. Simply enter your order number and email address! If you have any questions or concerns, feel free to reach out to us at <a href=\"mailto:info@titanpowerplus.com\">info@titanpowerplus.com</a>. We'll get back to you as fast as possible (usually within 24 hours). You can also contact us through our Contact Us page.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_WkxVG7": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Tech Specs",
            "content": "<h3>Materials</h3><p><br/>- Titan-reinforced core (body armor grade)<br/><br/>- Braided nylon jacket (anti-fray, anti-tear)<br/><br/>- 90° aluminum alloy connectors<br/><br/>- Rubber cable tie<br/><br/></p><h3>Performance</h3><p><br/>- Fast charging (USB-C PD)<br/><br/>- SmartChip™ for safe power delivery<br/><br/>- USB 3.1 data transfer (10 Gbps)<br/><br/>- 300,000+ bend lifespan (30x stronger than standard)<br/><br/>- Pair with the Titan PD Plug for fastest charge speeds<br/><br/></p><h3>Compatibility</h3><p><br/>- USB-C, Lightning devices<br/><br/>- iPhone (14, 13, 12, SE), iPad, iPad Pro, MacBook Air/Pro<br/><br/>- Samsung Galaxy (S24/S23/S22), Note series, Z Flip/Fold<br/><br/>- Google Pixel, OnePlus, Huawei, Xiaomi, Motorola, Sony<br/><br/>- Power banks, car chargers, wall adapters, and more<br/><br/>- Covers USB-C to USB-C, USB-A to USB-C & Lightning setups<br/><br/>- Universal compatibility across all major devices (Not limited to above)<br/><br/></p><h3>Warranty</h3><p><br/>- 2-Year Warranty – full coverage for peace of mind</p>"
          }
        }
      },
